--------------------------------------------------------------------------------
Third-party dependency notice
--------------------------------------------------------------------------------
gitfull's own dependency set is intentionally minimal and strictly
permissively licensed: `serde` and `toml` (MIT OR Apache-2.0). See
docs/AUDIT.md for the full dependency-license posture.

gitfull acts as an orchestrator: when it builds a *target* package for a
user, that package (and its own dependencies, whatever their licenses) is
fetched and built strictly inside that package's isolated sandbox. gitfull
neither links nor incorporates that code into itself, so target-package
license terms do not attach to gitfull.
